      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "For travelers, Hãy nói từ từ nhé is the phrase to keep ready for \"Please say it slowly\" in moments when Vietnamese stops making sense. This is for when the conversation is stuck and you need a clearer next step fast. It works best when you focus on putting the need first and leaving room for the helper to confirm the detail. After you say it, listen for a confirmation, a handoff, a price, or a follow-up question; the next rows help you keep the exchange moving.",
