      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use Hãy nói từ từ nhé as your first sentence for \"Please say it slowly\". This is for when the conversation is stuck and you need a clearer next step fast. Leave a short pause after the phrase so the other person can answer with a confirmation, a handoff, a price, or a follow-up question. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
