      "body": "These phrases keep the interaction cooperative when repeating the same words is not helping. For \"Please say it slowly\", Hãy nói từ từ nhé helps by putting the need first and leaving room for the helper to confirm the detail. Pause after the phrase so the person can confirm before you add more words.",
